title LeeTKOB PA#3: from submission to the TA review queue
autonumber
hide footbox

actor Student
actor TA
participant "API (Fastify)" as API
queue "pg-boss queue" as Q
participant "Worker" as W
participant "Sandbox container" as SB
participant "OpenRouter" as LLM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Student submits ==
Student -> API ++ : POST /v1/labs/{labId}/submissions
API -> DB : insert submission (status queued)
API ->> Q : enqueue judge job
API --> Student -- : 201, status queued

== Judge job ==
Q ->> W ++ : deliver judge job
W -> DB : load code, tests, limits\nset status judging
W -> SB ++ : docker run, code on stdin
note over SB : g++ -std=c++17 -O2\nno network, no secrets
SB --> W -- : outcome of each test
W -> DB : save test results and final status
opt status is accepted
  W ->> Q : enqueue review job
end
deactivate W

== Review job ==
Q ->> W ++ : deliver review job
W -> W : strip comments, keep line numbers
W -> W : hard rules on each "Do not use" list
loop each semantic constraint
  W -> LLM ++ : statement, constraints,\ncomment-free code
  LLM --> W -- : JSON verdict with evidence
  W -> W : check schema, time limit, evidence
  W -> DB : log the call in model_calls
end
W -> DB : insert verdicts\nON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
deactivate W
note over W, DB : A bad schema or a timeout\nbecomes unsure with a reason

== Student checks the result ==
Student -> API ++ : GET submission
API -> DB : read status and test results
API --> Student -- : status and per-test results,\nno test data, no constraint verdicts

== TA reviews ==
TA -> API ++ : GET /v1/labs/{labId}/review-queue
API -> DB : violations, unsures, 10% of passes
API --> TA -- : verdicts with evidence lines\nand deductions
